<title>INDONESIA: Indonesian forex market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Indonesian forex market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indonesian foreign exchange market was closed on Wednesday for a Hindu holiday.</p>
<p>Trading will resume on Thursday.</p>
<p>On Tuesday, the rupiah was last traded in Jakarta at 2,406.25/6.50 against the dollar compared to an opening of 2,405.00/6.00.</p>
</text>
